From: Jon West <electrikjesus@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 16:19:21 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] SystemUI: Send status bar icons to the launcher tray

With persist.retro.ui_layout=system_bar, SystemUI sends the visible status
bar slot icons (Bluetooth, alarm, Do Not Disturb, location, hotspot, VPN,
...) to the launcher through ILauncherProxy whenever they change, honoring
the status bar icon hide list, so the taskbar tray can show them when the
top status bar is hidden.
